{"nodes": [{"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_09_blindar_superficie_leitura_design", "label": "Design: blindar-superficie-leitura", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-09-blindar-superficie-leitura/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "rationale_required_false_idunicocontacontratante", "label": "D1: required=false em vez de reescrever spec", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-09-blindar-superficie-leitura/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tornar idUnicoContaContratante opcional no binding para que a valida\u00e7\u00e3o de neg\u00f3cio no service seja alcan\u00e7ada e produza 422 estruturado, em vez de legitimar o 400 nativo do Spring documentando-o na spec."}, {"id": "rationale_indice_composto_particionamento", "label": "D5: \u00edndice composto medido, n\u00e3o ato de f\u00e9", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-09-blindar-superficie-leitura/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u00cdndice (id_unico_conta_contratante, status, data_hora_inclusao DESC) precisa ser validado com EXPLAIN ANALYZE antes/depois; \u00edndice errado custa escrita sem devolver leitura. Resultado real: com volume de teste insuficiente (21 linhas), o plano n\u00e3o mudou (989 Seq Scans, 0 Index Scans), reavalia\u00e7\u00e3o pendente com volume real."}, {"id": "rationale_whitelist_por_rejeicao", "label": "D4: whitelist por rejei\u00e7\u00e3o, invertendo o default", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-09-blindar-superficie-leitura/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "mapearCampoDTO tinha default->campoDtoOuEntidade (passa qualquer string ao Sort); invertido para default->lan\u00e7a erro de neg\u00f3cio, tornando a lista de campos orden\u00e1veis fechada e expl\u00edcita."}], "edges": [{"source": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_09_blindar_superficie_leitura_design", "target": "rationale_required_false_idunicocontacontratante", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-09-blindar-superficie-leitura/design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_09_blindar_superficie_leitura_design", "target": "rationale_indice_composto_particionamento", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-09-blindar-superficie-leitura/design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_08_09_blindar_superficie_leitura_design", "target": "rationale_whitelist_por_rejeicao", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-08-09-blindar-superficie-leitura/design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}